#: includes/class-pncp-admin-traffic.php:828
msgid ""
"Each request is stored with its time, IP, country, method, status, address, "
"referrer, User-Agent, size and cache status. Everything stays in this site's"
" database; nothing is sent anywhere. Only one source is counted at a time, "
"so a request is never counted twice."
