msgstr ""
"Η πλοήγηση με το πληκτρολόγιο (Tab, βέλη, Enter) δεν επηρεάζεται ποτέ."

#: includes/class-pncp-admin.php:980 includes/class-pncp-setting-labels.php:49
msgid "Developer tools shortcuts (F12, Ctrl+Shift+I/J/C/K, Cmd+Opt+I/J/C/U)"
