msgstr "Αφαίρεση του κανόνα «%s» από το Bunny CDN;"

#: includes/class-pncp-bunny.php:4487
msgid ""
"Made by an older version with more entries in one condition than Bunny "
"accepts: it is sent again, split, with the next run. If it stays like this, "
