"τους επισκέπτες."

#: includes/class-pncp-health.php:1315
msgid "ScrapeLock's private folders can be read from the web"
msgstr "Οι ιδιωτικοί φάκελοι του ScrapeLock μπορούν να διαβαστούν από το web"

#: includes/class-pncp-health.php:1315
msgid ""
"A test file in these folders could be downloaded from its web address, so "
