msgstr "Δημιουργία νέων κωδικών ανάκτησης"

#: includes/class-pncp-lockdown.php:4936
msgid "Remove the authenticator app"
msgstr "Αφαίρεση της εφαρμογής επαλήθευσης"

#: includes/class-pncp-lockdown.php:4944
msgid "Lost your phone?"
msgstr "Χάσατε το τηλέφωνό σας;"

#: includes/class-pncp-lockdown.php:4945
msgid ""
"Type one of your recovery codes in the unlock field instead of an app code. "
"No codes left? Add this line to wp-config.php (FTP or your hosting panel), "
"then remove the app here and connect a new one:"
msgstr ""
